```

Key columns worth showing on the diagram:

- `food_items`: `stock_count`, `low_stock_threshold`, `availability` — the three that drive the availability rule
- `orders`: `status`, `priority_score`, `manual_priority`, `promised_minutes` — the smart-queue inputs
- `delivery_agents`: `status` — AVAILABLE / ASSIGNED / OUT_FOR_DELIVERY / OFFLINE
- `item_pair_counts`: `food_id_a`, `food_id_b`, `pair_count` — the co-occurrence table

