## System flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Customer browses menu] --> B{Availability?}
    B -- OUT_OF_STOCK --> B1[Add to cart disabled]
    B -- LOW_STOCK --> C[Shows 'Only N left']
    B -- AVAILABLE --> C
    C --> D[Add to cart]
    D --> E[Checkout: UPI / Card / COD simulated]
    E --> F[Order PLACED, stock reduced, item pairs recorded]
    F --> G[Priority score computed]
    G --> H[Smart Order Queue at the restaurant]
    H --> I[CONFIRMED]
    I --> J[PREPARING]
    J --> K[READY]
    K --> L{Free agent?}
    L -- yes --> M[ASSIGNED round-robin]
    L -- no --> K
    M --> N[OUT_FOR_DELIVERY]
    N --> O[DELIVERED, agent back to AVAILABLE]
    O --> P[Customer reviews the order]

    F -.cancel while PLACED/CONFIRMED.-> Q[CANCELLED: stock restored, payment refunded]
    J -.cancel attempt.-> R[InvalidCancellationException -> Help Centre]
```

