## Priority score, for the report

| Signal | Maximum | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| Waiting time | 40 | 2 points per minute waited |
| Urgency | 30 | ≤0 min of the promise left: 30 · ≤10: 25 · ≤20: 15 · otherwise 5 |
| Preparation time | 20 | longest dish prep time × 0.6 |
| Complexity | 10 | 2 points per item |

Bands: **HIGH** ≥ 75 · **MEDIUM** ≥ 50 · **LOW** below 50.
Orders are ranked with `PriorityQueue` and a `Comparator` on the effective priority
(manual override if set, otherwise the computed score), with the older order winning ties.
